* ============================================================================
* 20_substance_disclosure_quality.do — P3 披露质量协变检验 (disclosure quality)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: §5.5.2 P3 extras (R7-M03) — substantiveness × disclosure quality 框架
*
* 作为 salvage 路径基础 (按 §B.3 sequential_resubmission JFE 公司金融轨)。
* 若 SMJ/AMJ/ASQ 级联拒稿, P3 改写为独立 disclosure quality paper.
*
* 检验结构:
*   (1) 披露质量度量: ln_fintech_mdna_length (复用 P2 mediator), 或
*       spec 中自定义的 W&Z 披露指数。
*   (2) substantiveness × 披露质量交互 → 对长期 ROA 的效应。
*   (3) 验证: 高披露质量的实质性宣告 → 长期效应为正;
*       低披露质量的象征性宣告 → 出现长期反转。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* (1) 基准: 长期 ROA ~ substantiveness × disclosure_quality
capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
if !_rc {
    gen subst_x_disclose = {{MAIN_TREAT}} * ln_fintech_mdna_length
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} ln_fintech_mdna_length subst_x_disclose $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo subst_x_disclose
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] ln_fintech_mdna_length not in panel (M0.5.11 enrichment pending)"
}

* (2) 披露质量四分位
capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
if !_rc {
    * fix(omni-g-templates-02, 2026-06-11): 四分位改按年内切 (by-year xtile)。旧版
    * pooled 全样本切分位: 全量 T=18 下披露长度随披露监管趋严系统性上行 → 分位组
    * 混入年代效应, 且阈值含未来年份 (in-sample 前视泄漏)。
    gen disclose_q = .
    quietly levelsof year, local(_disq_yrs)
    foreach y of local _disq_yrs {
        capture xtile _disq_tmp = ln_fintech_mdna_length if year == `y', n(4)
        if !_rc {
            replace disclose_q = _disq_tmp if year == `y'
            drop _disq_tmp
        }
        else {
            capture drop _disq_tmp
            display "  [SKIP] year `y': within-year disclosure quartile 切分失败 (单元过小)"
        }
    }
    forval q = 1/4 {
        count if disclose_q == `q' & !missing({{MAIN_TREAT}}, {{MAIN_DV}})
        if r(N) >= 10 {
            reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls if disclose_q == `q', ///
                absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
            eststo disclose_q_`q'
        }
        else {
            display "  [SKIP] disclose_q=`q' has " r(N) " obs (< 10; R7-m01)"
        }
    }
}

* (3) v3.5.1 A1 三角化扩展 (per stage3_v3_5_1 plan v0.3 §2.5.3 R3-补遗):
* mean_clarity_score_full (A1 lexical clarity) + ln_fintech_mdna_length (P2 mediator)
* 双代理 disclosure quality 三角化, 检验 substantive 行动是否同时具备
* (a) 高披露长度 (P2 既有 mediator) 和 (b) 高 lexical clarity (LM 2011 JF 风格).
* 锚定: Loughran & McDonald (2011) JF 66(1) + You et al. (2018) hhx055.
capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full
if !_rc {
    capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
    if !_rc {
        * Panel C: 双代理三角化 (A1 + ln_fintech_mdna_length 联合)
        reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} mean_clarity_score_full ln_fintech_mdna_length $controls, ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
        eststo subst_triangulate
        * Panel D: A1 × {{MAIN_TREAT}} 交互
        reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} c.mean_clarity_score_full##c.{{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
        eststo subst_clarity_interact
        display "  [OK] v3.5.1 A1 三角化扩展 (plan v0.3 §2.5.3)"
    }
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] mean_clarity_score_full not in panel (v3.5.1 D5 enrichment pending)"
}

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — 本表全部估计名都在守卫
* 块内 (subst_x_disclose/disclose_q_*/subst_triangulate/subst_clarity_interact),
* 任一守卫跳过后旧版硬点名 → r(111) 丢整表; 全空时如实告警跳过。
qui estimates dir
local models `r(names)'
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] disclosure quality 表无任何已存储估计 (enrichment 列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/table_disclosure_quality.tex", replace ///
        star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
        title("P3 Substantiveness × Disclosure Quality (JFE salvage; v3.5.1 A1 triangulation)") ///
        addnotes("Disclosure quality = ln\_fintech\_mdna\_length; 4 quartiles ranked Q1=low Q4=high (within-year xtile). v3.5.1: + A1 lexical clarity triangulation per LM 2011 JF.")

    display "[OK] 20_substance_disclosure_quality → $tables_dir/table_disclosure_quality.tex"
}
